{"id": "bart-holiday-salary-continuation-and-missed-pay", "title": "BART missed holiday pay for injured workers and paid others twice", "seconds": 59.7, "voice": "elevenlabs:iPYqcpY8j8Ap4jUf28I3", "narrator": "Michael", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "29adfef018e5c2e9", "words": 137, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Who received holiday pay when an injury kept a BART employee off work?", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 6.3, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Holiday", "pay", "during", "industrial", "leave"], "sub": "Eligibility depended on the bargaining unit and date"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.44, 0.96, 1.36, 2.02, 2.26, 2.36, 2.77, 3.08, 3.16, 3.44, 4.26, 4.6]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "For one bargaining unit, the agreement listed industrial disability", "t0": 6.3, "t1": 10.54, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "atu", "kicker": "Eligibility depended on the bargaining unit and date", "text": "26 continuous weeks", "mark": "26"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.29, 0.6, 1.12, 1.71, 1.87, 2.35, 2.77, 3.32]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "after 26 weeks as unpaid status.", "t0": 10.54, "t1": 13.83, "shot": "s1b", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "26 continuous weeks"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.38, 0.96, 1.67, 2.0, 2.7]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The inspector found examples going both ways.", "t0": 14.05, "t1": 16.92, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Missing and duplicate pay"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.75, 1.05, 1.69, 2.02, 2.34]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "One employee received holiday wages twice. Another missed months of payments.", "t0": 17.04, "t1": 22.08, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "test", "kicker": "A payroll test found missed and duplicate payments", "tex